    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "考点1：零输入响应的s域求解",
        "text_level": 2,
        "bbox": [
            144,
            120,
            468,
            140
        ],
        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "1、原理：",
        "bbox": [
            146,
            152,
            233,
            168
        ],
        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\nf ^ {\\prime} (t) \\leftrightarrow s F (s) - f (0 _ {-})\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            401,
            177,
            594,
            200
        ],
        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\nf ^ {\\prime \\prime} (t) \\leftrightarrow s ^ {2} F (s) - s f (0 _ {-}) - f ^ {\\prime} (0 _ {-})\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            359,
            208,
            636,
            229
        ],
        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "2、步骤：零输入响应满足齐次，方程两边同时进行拉氏变换，然后写出 $R_{zi}(s)$ 表达式，最后逆变换。",
        "bbox": [
            144,
            237,
            848,
            287
        ],
        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "例 26: $r''(t)+3r'(t)+2r(t)=e'(t)+3e(t), r(0_{-})=1, r'(0_{-})=2$ ，求 $r_{zi}(t)$ 。",
        "bbox": [
            144,
            545,
            734,
            567
        ],
        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "解析：",
        "bbox": [
            146,
            577,
            205,
            595
        ],
        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "header",
        "text": "B站up：信号与系统\\_谷哥",
        "bbox": [
