    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "考点2：零状态响应的s域求解",
        "bbox": [
            146,
            85,
            468,
            105
        ],
        "page_idx": 1
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\nR _ {z s} (s) = H (s) \\cdot E (s) \\xrightarrow {\\text {逆变换}} r _ {z s} (t)\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            359,
            116,
            636,
            137
        ],
        "page_idx": 1
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "考点 3：系统完全响应的求解流程",
        "bbox": [
            144,
            173,
            502,
            193
        ],
        "page_idx": 1
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "零状态一律用LT，零输入尽量用时域(除非题目要求s域)",
        "bbox": [
            146,
            205,
            643,
            223
        ],
        "page_idx": 1
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\n\\text {微分方程} \\rightarrow \\left\\{\\begin{array}{l l}\\text {已知} r ^ {(k)} (0 _ {-})&\\left[\\begin{array}{l}\\text {时域} r _ {z i} (t)\\\\\\text {LT} r _ {z s} (t)\\end{array}\\right]\\rightarrow r (t) = r _ {z i} (t) + r _ {z s} (t)\\\\\\text {已知} r ^ {(k)} (0 _ {+})&\\left[\\begin{array}{l}\\text {LT求} r _ {z s} (t) \\xrightarrow [ \\text {特解} ]{\\text {解形式}} \\text {时域} r (t) \\xrightarrow [ (\\text {含系数}) ]{r ^ {(k)} (0 _ {+})} r (t) \\xrightarrow [ r _ {z i} (t) = r (t) - r _ {z s} (t) ]{\\text {时域}:}\\\\\\text {设} r _ {z i} (t) \\text {解(含系数)} \\rightarrow r (t) \\text {完全(含系数)} \\xrightarrow {r ^ {(k)} (0 _ {+})} r _ {z i} (t) \\text {和} r (t)\\end{array}\\right.\\end{array}\\right.\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            200,
            234,
            794,
            362
        ],
        "page_idx": 1
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "例27：描述某LTI系统的微分方程为",
        "bbox": [
            144,
            395,
            472,
            412
        ],
        "page_idx": 1
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\ny ^ {\\prime \\prime} (t) + 3 y ^ {\\prime} (t) + 2 y (t) = f ^ {\\prime} (t) + 4 f (t)\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            329,
            423,
            663,
            442
        ],
        "page_idx": 1
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "求在下列条件下的零输入响应和零状态响应。",
        "bbox": [
            147,
            450,
            546,
            466
        ],
        "page_idx": 1
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\n(1) f (t) = e ^ {- 2 t} u (t), y (0 _ {-}) = 1, y ^ {\\prime} (0 _ {-}) = 1 。\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            144,
            478,
            542,
            498
        ],
        "page_idx": 1
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "(2) $f(t)=e^{-2t}u(t)$ , $y(0_{+})=1$ , $y'(0_{+})=2$ 。",
        "bbox": [
            144,
            508,
            544,
            527
        ],
        "page_idx": 1
    },
    {
        "type": "header",
        "text": "B站up：信号与系统\\_谷哥",
        "bbox": [
            115,
            24,
