    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "考点4：系统函数可约性对系统分析的影响",
        "bbox": [
            146,
            85,
            598,
            105
        ],
        "page_idx": 3
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "【引例】",
        "bbox": [
            154,
            117,
            240,
            137
        ],
        "page_idx": 3
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "1、微分方程的隐含信息",
        "bbox": [
            146,
            470,
            366,
            488
        ],
        "page_idx": 3
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "(1)阶数(特征根的个数、极点的个数): 看方程的左边, 与右边无关",
        "bbox": [
            147,
            493,
            746,
            512
        ],
        "page_idx": 3
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "(2)零输入响应的解形式",
        "bbox": [
            147,
            516,
            366,
            533
        ],
        "page_idx": 3
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "(3)零状态响应的解形式: 左边方程+激励 $\\Rightarrow y_{zs}(t)$ 解形式一般性",
        "bbox": [
            147,
            539,
            709,
            558
        ],
        "page_idx": 3
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "(4) 完全响应的解形式",
        "bbox": [
            147,
            563,
            347,
            580
        ],
        "page_idx": 3
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "(5) 系统函数 $\\leftrightarrow$ 微分方程",
        "bbox": [
            147,
            586,
            369,
            602
        ],
        "page_idx": 3
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "以 $y''(t)+3y'(t)+2y(t)=f'(t)+4f(t)$ 为例：",
        "bbox": [
            147,
            608,
            549,
            627
        ],
        "page_idx": 3
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\n\\begin{array}{r l} & {\\text {①} f (t) = e ^ {- 3 t} u (t)} \\\\ & {\\qquad \\Rightarrow y _ {z i} (t) = A _ {1} e ^ {- t} + A _ {2} e ^ {- 2 t} \\Rightarrow y _ {z s} (t) = A _ {3} e ^ {- t} + A _ {4} e ^ {- 2 t} + B e ^ {- 3 t}} \\end{array}\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            144,
            631,
            766,
            676
        ],
        "page_idx": 3
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\n\\begin{array}{r l} & {\\text {②} f (t) = e ^ {- 2 t} u (t)} \\\\ & {\\qquad \\Rightarrow y _ {z i} (t) = A _ {1} e ^ {- t} + A _ {2} e ^ {- 2 t} \\Rightarrow y _ {z s} (t) = A _ {3} e ^ {- t} + A _ {4} e ^ {- 2 t} + B t e ^ {- 2 t}} \\end{array}\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            142,
            677,
            771,
            722
        ],
        "page_idx": 3
    },
    {
        "type": "header",
        "text": "B站up：信号与系统\\_谷哥",
        "bbox": [
            115,
            23,
            344,
            43
        ],
        "page_idx": 3
    },
    {
        "type": "header",
        "text": "公众号：通信考研小马哥",
        "bbox": [
            653,
            23,
            880,
            42
        ],
        "page_idx": 3
    },
    {
        "type": "footer",
        "text": "官网：tongxinkaoyan.com",
        "bbox": [
            117,
            956,
            354,
            975
        ],
        "page_idx": 3
    },
    {
        "type": "footer",
        "text": "梦马班讲义",
        "bbox": [
            774,
            954,
            880,
            973
        ],
        "page_idx": 3
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "2、系统函数的可约性",
        "text_level": 2,
        "bbox": [
            144,
            87,
            346,
            104
        ],
        "page_idx": 4
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\n\\text {以} y ^ {\\prime \\prime} (t) + 3 y ^ {\\prime} (t) + 2 y (t) = f ^ {\\prime} (t) + f (t), f (t) = e ^ {- 3 t} u (t), y (0 _ {-}) = 1, y ^ {\\prime} (0 _ {-}) = 1\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            144,
            109,
            823,
            130
        ],
        "page_idx": 4
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "为例：",
        "bbox": [
            147,
            134,
            203,
            151
        ],
        "page_idx": 4
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "(1)由方程可列 $y_{zi}(t)$ 的形式为：",
        "bbox": [
            147,
            156,
            421,
            175
        ],
        "page_idx": 4
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\ny _ {z i} (t) = A _ {1} e ^ {- t} + A _ {2} e ^ {- 2 t}\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            420,
            179,
            635,
            199
        ],
        "page_idx": 4
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "代入 $y^{(k)}(0_{-})$ 值后可得:",
        "bbox": [
            157,
            203,
            366,
            221
        ],
        "page_idx": 4
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\ny _ {z i} (t) = (e ^ {- t} - 2 e ^ {- 2 t}) u (t)\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            379,
            233,
            613,
            252
        ],
        "page_idx": 4
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "(2)由方程和激励可列 $y_{zs}(t)$ 的形式为:",
        "bbox": [
            147,
            263,
            485,
            281
        ],
        "page_idx": 4
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\ny _ {z s} (t) = A _ {3} e ^ {- 3 t} + A _ {4} e ^ {- 2 t} + B e ^ {- 3 t}\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            349,
            285,
            647,
            306
        ],
        "page_idx": 4
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\n\\begin{array}{r l} & {H (s) = \\frac {\\text {右边}}{\\text {左边}} = \\frac {s + 1}{s ^ {2} + 3 s + 2} = \\frac {s + 1}{(s + 1) (s + 2)} = \\frac {1}{(s + 2)}} \\\\ & {\\qquad \\Rightarrow Y _ {z s} (s) = H (s) \\cdot F (s) = \\frac {1}{(s + 2)} \\cdot \\frac {1}{(s + 3)}} \\\\ & {\\qquad \\Rightarrow y _ {z s} (t) = (e ^ {- 2 t} - e ^ {- 3 t}) u (t)} \\end{array}\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            258,
            313,
            737,
            430
        ],
        "page_idx": 4
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "由上例可见，系统函数可约性对系统分析的影响，具体如下：",
        "bbox": [
            146,
            439,
            687,
            457
        ],
        "page_idx": 4
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "(1) 对零输入响应的计算和解形式均无影响;",
        "bbox": [
            147,
            462,
            536,
            480
        ],
        "page_idx": 4
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "(2) 可以简化零状态响应的计算，解形式中会缺少某些极点 (特征根) 信息；",
        "bbox": [
            147,
            485,
            798,
            502
        ],
        "page_idx": 4
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "(3)零极点分布: 不影响零极点个数和求解, 但有部分零点和极点相同, 零极点图对应位置可以不画 (提前说明已约分) 或同时画零极点符号;",
        "bbox": [
            147,
            508,
            850,
            550
        ],
        "page_idx": 4
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "(4) 系统函数与微分方程",
        "bbox": [
            147,
            555,
            366,
            571
        ],
        "page_idx": 4
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "①(直接、间接)已知系统函数表达式，求方程时，该系统函数直接转换；",
        "bbox": [
            144,
            577,
            789,
            596
        ],
        "page_idx": 4
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "②(直接、间接)已知系统函数表达式，若有(阶数、零输入或其他隐含信息)，需要额外考虑方程阶数。",
        "bbox": [
            144,
            601,
            850,
            643
        ],
        "page_idx": 4
    },
    {
        "type": "header",
        "text": "B站up：信号与系统\\_谷哥",
